{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/566961-reaching-and-loci-questions","id":566961,"title":"Reaching and Loci questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-24T14:18:25-07:00","id":566961,"title":"Reaching and Loci questions","content":"Is Reaching something only Werewolves do? Do spirits do the same thing when they escape into the real world?<br /> <br /> ... which leads to the question, do spirits 'leak' into reality from Loci, or do they bleed in through other methods?<br /> <br /> Do other creatures/beings in the World of Darkness use Loci to reach the spirit world? Or is it a unique transit method for werewolves?<br /> <br /> What about other shapeshifters that aren't Hosts?<br /> <br /> ... and hey, what about hosts?<br /> <br /> Sorry if all this information is freely available I'm just trying to crash course it and I was hoping you guys could help!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T15:00:29-07:00","id":567038,"title":"","content":"Spirits also reach. Wherever the Gauntlet is, their Reaching attempt is penalized by its strength. But in a locus' zone of influence, spirits don't need to reach, they can just move across, and get a bonus to doing it. They can also passively sense resonance that matches their make-up across the Gauntlet, giving them reason to try and move across.<br /> <br /> In second edition, so far we don't have much information about the hosts, or much else beyond spirits, werewolves and idigam, who seem to use the same system as spirits.<br /> <br /> Reaching didn't exist in first edition, where we had stepping sideways. It was something hosts and changing breeds had an ability to imitate. had an ability to Most other games didn't really recognize loci, though the Ordo Dracul occasionally used them as dragons nests.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-24-2015, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T15:13:20-07:00","id":567051,"title":"","content":"How about those related to Werewolves? Can they do it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T15:16:07-07:00","id":567057,"title":"","content":"You mean wolf-blooded? There's a Tell, Shadow Twin, that allows certain wolf-blooded to do it, and another that allows werewolves and spirits to use them to Reach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T17:41:46-07:00","id":567155,"title":"","content":"Actually, this is something I'd like the developers to weigh in on. My understanding is:<br /> <br /> * Spirits can use Influences and Numina across the Gauntlet at a locus. Otherwise, they need to have the Reaching Manifestation.<br /> * Spirits can cross the Gauntlet at a locus with a +2 to the roll. Otherwise, they need to have the Gauntlet Breach Manifestation be in the presence of a Resonant Condition.<br /> <br /> Where I am uncertain is with crossing the Gauntlet. It seems to be implied in a few places that any spirit can cross at a locus, but I have had no luck finding an explicit declaration of this. When they were taking comments on the initial PDF, I asked for clarification, but didn't see any in the final version.<br /> <br /> As for your other questions:<br /> <br /> * Ridden and Possessed cannot Reach.<br /> * Claimed can Reach (provided they are spirit-claimed rather than, say, ghost-claimed).<br /> * Hosts cannot Reach, though Beshilu may gnaw the Gauntlet until there is a hole that anything can pass through freely.<br /> * Wolf-Blooded cannot Reach without a Rite or Tell which allows it.<br /> <br /> Some of these are explicitly stated (like Claimed) and some are inferred (Ridden and Possessed can't because it explicitly says Claimed can, which implies it is an exception).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T17:50:52-07:00","id":567159,"title":"","content":"It seems to me like a very odd choice to call The Thing That Werewolves Do To Cross The Gauntlet &quot;Reaching,&quot; since &quot;Reach&quot; is also the name of a Manifestation, and that Manifestation does not do the same thing. When a Werewolf Reaches, they cross to the other side of the Gauntlet. When a Spirit uses the Reach Manifestation, they remain on the same side of the Gauntlet but gain the &quot;Reaching&quot; Condition, which allows them to use certain Numina across the Gauntlet. At a locus, they don't need the Reaching Condition to do so. As eberg said, it seems to be implied that Spirits should also be able to cross the Gauntlet at a locus, but there doesn't seem to be any actual rules mechanism that would allow them to do this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 06-24-2015, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T11:13:12-07:00","id":572930,"title":"","content":"Bueller... Bueller...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}